<title>SPAIN: Spain's Prosegur 9-mth net profit up 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Prosegur 9-mth net profit up 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish security group Prosegur said on Monday its net profit for the nine months to September was 2.34 billion pesetas, up five percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>Turnover rose 20 percent to 48.56 billion pesetas in the same period.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
